      "fine_trace_step": 15,
      "description": "At the later `compact_list(main_run_list)` call at line 1261, `newline` and `post_ltr` have both been rewritten to adjacent `LTR` level-0 runs, but the predicate still does not require equal isolate levels. The fix adds `RL_ISOLATE_LEVEL(list->prev) == RL_ISOLATE_LEVEL(list)` here so that second cross-isolate merge never reaches the crashing `merge_with_prev(post_ltr)`."
    },
