      "fine_trace_step": 16,
      "description": "AddressSanitizer crash site. During `merge_with_prev(post_ltr)`, `post_ltr->prev_isolate` still aliases the freed `fsi` run, so line 93 performs the heap-use-after-free write through that dangling isolate-link pointer."
